{
  "description": "S23: positions for the search computer opponent on the real board (rules/boards/standard-9x9.json, rules/pieces/) under the draft 2-player ruleset with the case's overrides. The Coast is open and there is no Tail, so only the pieces listed play. 'mates' means the chosen move must end the game in checkmate; 'plays' names the one move the bot must choose; 'avoids' names a move it must not choose.",
  "cases": [
